(I)--a son of Citraka;
1: Br. III. ७१. ११४; वा. ९६. ११३; Vi. IV. १४. ११.
stationed by कृष्ण at the northern gate of मथुरा for defence against जरासन्- dha; was on the right detachment of कृष्ण's army;
2: भा. X. ५०. २० [3]; [५० (v) १२].
killed in the यादव contest at प्रभासा.
3: Vi. V. ३७. ४६.
